--
The perfect-forward CTAD chain (__bind_back(_Fn...) with a non-pack
_Fn, the reduced libc++ ranges shape) called from a member function
template.  History: first surfaced as a symex assign_from_struct arity
CRASH (silent escape from the method-body drain, fixed round 117,
b44419e7a9); the resolution itself was fixed by the [dcl.fct]/6
non-pack `P...` normalization (round 118, df138b3e87).  The kernel's
original sizeof-based assertion depended on sizeof(empty class) >= 1,
which CBMC gets wrong (split to cpp11_sizeof_empty_class).
Runtime-verified g++ 13 / clang++ 18.
